 "avatar": "Flat avatars with a one-letter initial, a photo that fades in and a presence dot. Groups overlap and part on hover.",
 "data-table": "A sortable, filterable, paginated table with row selection and an indeterminate header checkbox; sort, filter and paging are pure functions.",
 "settings-row": "A label and description on the left with a control on the right; give it `checked` handling for a built-in switch or pass any control as children.",
 "api-key-row": "A named API key shown masked, with reveal, copy and regenerate buttons; copying confirms for two seconds in a live region.",
 "stat-card": "A KPI card whose number counts up, with a colored delta and a sparkline of this period against the last one that you can scrub.",
